manalyze (1.0.0-noble) noble; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.0.0.
  * Install manalyze.conf to /etc/manalyze in debian/rules. Upstream's new
    install(CODE) block prepends $DESTDIR to a path passed to file(INSTALL),
    which applies $DESTDIR itself, so the config file landed under a duplicated
    staging path and the binary package shipped a stray directory.
  * Let dh_shlibdeps run. The empty override left ${shlibs:Depends} unfilled,
    so the package declared no runtime dependencies at all; it now depends on
    libc6, libgcc-s1, libssl3t64 and libstdc++6.

 -- REMnux Distribution <distro@remnux.org>  Sun, 02 Aug 2026 19:55:00 -0400

